            "search": "index=aws eventSource = \"s3.amazonaws.com\" eventCategory=Data\n| rename additionalEventData.bytesTransferredOut as bytesOut\n| bin _time span=15m\n| rename requestParameters.bucketName as bucket_name\n| rename userIdentity.userName as src_user\n| where src_user != \"SplunkInput\"\n| stats sum(bytesOut) as bytesOutSum by src_user, bucket_name, _time\n| eval MegabytesOut=bytesOutSum/1024/1024\n| where MegabytesOut \u003e 1\n| sort -MegabytesOut\n| addinfo\n| eval rule_description=urldecode(\"Triggers+an+alert+when+a+user+transfers+a+large+amount+of+data+out+of+an+S3+bucket.%0AIndicating+potential+data+exfiltration+or+misuse+of+S3+resources.\")\n| eval trigger_range=strftime(info_min_time, \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %Z\").\" to \".strftime(info_max_time, \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %Z\")\n| eval query=urldecode(\"index%3Daws+eventSource+%3D+%22s3.amazonaws.com%22+eventCategory%3DData%0A%7C+rename+additionalEventData.bytesTransferredOut+as+bytesOut%0A%7C+bin+_time+span%3D15m%0A%7C+rename+requestParameters.bucketName+as+bucket_name%0A%7C+rename+userIdentity.userName+as+src_user%0A%7C+where+src_user+%21%3D+%22SplunkInput%22%0A%7C+stats+sum%28bytesOut%29+as+bytesOutSum+by+src_user%2C+bucket_name%2C+_time%0A%7C+eval+MegabytesOut%3DbytesOutSum%2F1024%2F1024%0A%7C+where+MegabytesOut+%3E+1%0A%7C+sort+-MegabytesOut\")\n| fields rule_description trigger_range query\n",
